<title>JAPAN: JT 96/97 group results on tobacco business.</title>
<headline>JT 96/97 group results on tobacco business.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.70 trln	 vs	    3.55 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  156.24		vs	  137.24</p>
<p> Current	    141.72		vs	  132.00</p>
<p> Net		   80.20		vs	   67.95</p>
<p> EPS	     40,098.57 yen	  vs     33,974.44 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	     -		vs		 -</p>
<p>NOTE - Japan Tobacco Inc has the sole rights to produce tobacco in Japan. The figures are the company&quot;s result on</p>
<p>tobacco business only.</p>
</text>
